       An initial experimental attempt at providing "try"/"catch" notation has
       been added.

           use feature 'try';

           try {
               a_function();
           }
           catch ($e) {
               warn "An error occurred: $e";
           }

       For more information, see "Try Catch Exception Handling" in perlsyn.

